        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: die Zulassung",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Zulassung — \"the admission; the registration (of a car)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Für die Zulassung zum Studium braucht man gute Noten. For admission to university you need good marks."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Zulassungen. For a car, die Zulassung is its registration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Zulassung is the noun of zulassen, built on lassen \"to let\", inherited from Old High German lāzan and Proto-Germanic lētaną (EtymDB): being let in."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling, explaining and describing at B1."
