          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "zulassen is built from zu and lassen \"to let, to let go\", inherited from Old High German lāzan and Proto-Germanic lētaną (EtymDB)."
